    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Phosphorus deficiency tillering greenhouse</rdfs:label>
    <ns1:definition xml:lang="en">In a greenhouse test, grow each line in culture solution under two conditions: 0.5ppm P (low P) and 10ppm P (standard P). Estimate the propoprtion of tillers that develop in low P out of the number that develop in standard P</ns1:definition>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://cropontology.org/rdf/Estimation"/>
