  </ns2:Class>
  <ns2:Class rdf:about="https://cropontology.org/rdf/CO_320:0000330">
    <ns1:definition xml:lang="en">Collect florets and fix in 3:1 Acetic acid:alcohol solution. Squeeze out pollen grains under a drop of acetocarmine stain, observe under a microscope at 10x10 magnification, and estimate the predominant staining behavior and number of nuclei visible</ns1:definition>
