    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Seeding date</rdfs:label>
    <ns1:definition xml:lang="en">Date of effective seeding, ie the date when seeds were first moistened This may be the date of soaking for pre-soaked seed, or the date of sowing for dry seed sown onto a wet seedbed, or the date when rain or other moisture becomes available to seed sown dry on a dry seedbed</ns1:definition>
